  "id": "urn:accord:stagecraft:test-inn-ambush:85-possessio-endpoint-migration",
  "dcterms:title": "Inn Ambush 85 Possessio endpoint migration (slice 2 commit 5, the last)",
  "dcterms:description": "TRANSITION CASE added 2026-08-15 (conformance-ladder discipline; sc.task.2026-07-29_0930 slice 2). Migrates the possessio v1 carriers - the contract pair (31 shape lines, 18 context mappings) and the two transfer-request fixtures - to the family kosm: namespace from the frozen mapping (45 rows, all map; the four once-needs-mint lifecycle terms opensAttunement/closesAttunement/opensEquipped/closesEquipped are now DECLARED at kosmion), with two successors resolved through the arm's own RENAMED chains: give -> transferActKind_give (2026-08-14 endpoint form) and transferActor -> transferActant -> transferGiver (2026-08-06, two hops - kosmion.ttl:442-448 says the mapping target must resolve through the whole chain at bind time). Journal/world/session possessio carriers: none live.",
  "hasCase": [
    {
      "type": "TransitionCase",
      "id": "#possessio-endpoint-migration",
      "fixtureRepo": "github.com/spectacular-voyage/test-inn-ambush",
